**临时查询函数请求日志方式**：

1. 访问（需要申请权限）：[https://taishan.alibaba-inc.com/#/fc/dashboard/log](https://taishan.alibaba-inc.com/#/fc/dashboard/log)
2. 根据函数服务的部署单元选择查询region，比如部署了张北 就选择 log-fc-self-monitor-zjk-corp  
 (https://intranetproxy.alipay.com/skylark/lark/0/2024/png/18156349/1710235476707-ff0da301-35e8-4273-a9ca-fb36ef3476dc.png) 
3. 选择时间段  
 (https://intranetproxy.alipay.com/skylark/lark/0/2024/png/18156349/1710235476704-026b2490-bbba-4c66-b8f7-acbb6c0da0c5.png) 
4. 选择 code 查询模式  
 (https://intranetproxy.alipay.com/skylark/lark/0/2024/png/18156349/1710235476707-36e11a3a-b74c-4604-8da4-0b8bcc6513c9.png) 
5. 确定函数查询信息
    1. 函数组名  
 (https://intranetproxy.alipay.com/skylark/lark/0/2024/png/18156349/1710235476774-22f2864e-b940-4334-9f76-f193f9df78a7.png) 
    2. accountID  
 (https://intranetproxy.alipay.com/skylark/lark/0/2024/png/18156349/1710235476733-2e0ef9c5-fc51-482c-a27b-4262f5733f7c.png) 
6. 输入查询条件，
    1. 比如我想查询返回 500 的所有请求

```plain
{log_type="service_metrics",module="api_server",operation="InvokeFunction",accountID="xxxx",clusterName="fc-zjk-internal"} |= "函数组名" |=`fcStatus":500`
```

1. 比如想查询某个鹰眼ID的请求

```plain
{log_type="service_metrics",module="api_server",operation="InvokeFunction",accountID="xxxx",clusterName="fc-zjk-internal"} |= "函数组名" |=`eagleeyeTraceID":"74a2b00517006359080475043e`
```

